Table full name: bigquery-public-data.new_york_trees.tree_census_1995
Column name: recordid Type: INT64 Description: A unique identifier for each record in the table. Does not correspond to other datasets or identify the tree itself.
Column name: address Type: STRING Description: Address of the tree.
Column name: house_number Type: STRING Description: Numerical portion of the address.
Column name: street Type: STRING Description: Street where address for tree is located.
Column name: zip_original Type: INT64 Description: The zip code originally geocoded to the address using LION 02A
Column name: cb_original Type: INT64 Description: The community board originally geocoded to the address using LION 02A
Column name: site Type: STRING Description: This field clarifies the position relative to the address for trees not located in the front of buildings.
Column name: species Type: STRING Description: Species of the tree using a four-letter code, comprised of the first two letters of the genus followed by the first two letters of the species.
Column name: diameter Type: INT64 Description: Diameter of the tree as measured at approximately 4.5 feet from the ground.
Column name: status Type: STRING Description: Overall tree condition.
Column name: wires Type: STRING Description: Whether the tree is located under utility wires
Column name: sidewalk_condition Type: STRING Description: Whether the tree roots have lifted the adjacent sidewalk.
Column name: support_structure Type: STRING Description: Whether the tree has support structures installed.
Column name: borough Type: STRING Description: Borough where tree was recorded.
Column name: x Type: FLOAT64 Description: X coordinate of point in the NAD_1983_StatePlane_New_York_Long_Island_FIPS_3104_Feet coordinate system, geocoded using LION 02A
Column name: y Type: FLOAT64 Description: Y coordinate of point in the NAD_1983_StatePlane_New_York_Long_Island_FIPS_3104_Feet coordinate system, geocoded using LION 02A
Column name: longitude Type: FLOAT64 Description: Longitude of point in decimal degrees as geocoded using LION 02A
Column name: latitude Type: FLOAT64 Description: Latitude of point in decimal degrees as geocoded using LION 02A
Column name: cb_new Type: INT64 Description: Community Board geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: zip_new Type: INT64 Description: Zip Code geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: censustract_2010 Type: STRING Description: 2010 Census Tract geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: censusblock_2010 Type: STRING Description: 2010 Census Block geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: nta_2010 Type: STRING Description: Neighborhood Tabulation Area geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: segmentid Type: INT64 Description: LION SegmentID geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: spc_common Type: STRING Description: This is the common name for the species of this tree.
Column name: spc_latin Type: STRING Description: This is the latin/scientific name for the species of this tree.
Column name: location Type: STRING Description: 
